 "description": "<p>Rotation is the feature most rose-shaped toys skip, and this one puts it front and center. Ten vibration modes handle the classic pulsing work, while five rotation modes spin the head in wide, slow circles — the kind of internal motion that is hard to replicate by hand and impossible to get from a static shaft.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"vibrator purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/vibratorpurple_8_480x480.jpg?v=1695803893\"></p>\n<p>The two systems are meant to be layered. Start with a steady vibration to warm up, add a gentle rotation once you relax, then climb the intensities together as the session goes on. The body is contoured for a comfortable grip, and the controls sit where your thumb lands, so switching modes does not interrupt the rhythm.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"vibrator purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/vibratorpurple_7_480x480.jpg?v=1695803890\"></p>\n<p>Because the rotating head does the traveling for you, there is less angling and adjusting than with a fixed toy — set the depth, pick the pattern, and let it work.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"vibrator purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/vibratorpurple_4_480x480.jpg?v=1695803879\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 10</li>\n<li>Rotation modes: 5</li>\n<li>Design: ergonomic grip, simple one-hand controls</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX6, safe in shower and bath</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"vibrator purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/vibratorpurple_2_480x480.jpg?v=1695803876\"><br />\n<img alt=\"vibrator purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/vibratorpurple_2_480x480.jpg?v=1695803876\"></p>\n<p>A rose toy for people who already know what vibration alone feels like and want the second dimension.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose vibrator combining 10 vibration modes with 5 rotating-head rotation modes, an ergonomic grip and IPX6 waterproof body for the bath.</p>\n",
